{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>英偉達（NVIDIA）公布，英偉達董事會恢復黃仁勳（Jensen Huang）的行政總裁（CEO）職務。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201657774405062656452791.jpeg/zg4Hv9mn-adlsJIBPlPMx0ve-hau1qNGFMEeiRTBHok\"/><p>英偉達在聲明宣布，即日起黃仁勳將重返公司，擔任行政總裁（CEO）兼總裁（President），並重任董事會成員。聲明稱，在與黃仁勳先生進行一系列討論與會晤後，董事會全體一致投票通過其回任。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:15:30.146791+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:02:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:09:00.774177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:09:00.774177+00:00","content_hash":"35f674f5e85184d975e29893af13f57a3e6516d194d9c339edfc75528122b0c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}